sequenceDiagram
 participant R as Router / assembler
 participant D as SQLite owner
 participant P as Provider adapter
 participant B as Tool broker
 R->>P: Prepare current native envelope and capabilities
 R->>D: Save request / attempt / pin and admission
 D-->>R: Committed receipt
 R->>P: Send with host-resolved secret handle
 P-->>R: Ordered text / native item / argument fragments
 R->>D: Persist bounded attributed chunks
 Note over R,B: Fragments are not dispatchable calls
 P-->>R: Valid complete calls and terminal tool turn
 R->>D: Save complete envelopes, IDs and ordinals
 R->>B: Admit eligible independent operations
 B->>D: Persist each observed result or scoped wait
 D-->>R: Durable responses in recorded call order
 R->>P: Native paired continuation or new event boundary
 Note over R,P: Preserve same-provider opaque state and images
